re></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Political_Influence_Plan\" title=\"Political Influence Plan\">Political Influence Plan</a></li>\n<li>Flaev Linnacker – Deceased; whose remains are behind <a href=\"/wiki/Bruc_and_Pishe%27s_Emporium#Outside_the_building\" title=\"Bruc and Pishe's Emporium\">Bruc and Pishe's Emporium</a></li>\n<li>Rewth Linnacker – Referenced in the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Art_Show_Schedule\" title=\"Art Show Schedule\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Art_Show_Schedule\" title=\"Art Show Schedule\">Art Show Schedule</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ruth_Linnacker\" title=\"Ruth Linnacker\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png/30px-Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png/45px-Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png/60px-Portrait_Ruth_Linnacker.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ruth Linnacker\" src